    <tags>vidra video downloader media yt-dlp youtube audio</tags>
    <summary>The ultimate, lightning-fast video download manager.</summary>
    <description>
      Meet Vidra, the ultimate open-source video download manager designed for power users who demand speed, reliability, and a beautiful interface. Built with a modern Flutter frontend and a robust Python backend (powered by yt-dlp and FFmpeg), Vidra brings a premium downloading experience right to your PC!

      Features:
      - Lightning-Fast &amp; Reliable: Leverages the uncompromised power of yt-dlp to support downloading from hundreds of sites.
      - Advanced Processing: Integrated FFmpeg handles complex media processing tasks effortlessly in the background.
      - Privacy-Focused &amp; Open Source: Zero telemetry, offline-first, and 100% Free and Open-Source Software (FOSS).
      - Always Up-to-Date (OTA): Built-in Over-The-Air updates ensure your core engines are always running the latest versions.
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/chomusuke-mk/vidra/releases/latest</releaseNotes>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
